														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4845788">
									

<p>SCP-914 was written over 12 years ago, making it among the earliest work on the site. The quality of the writing may not be up to current site standards, but it's kept around due to its overwhelming popularity, which is valid even if some of that popularity is based in nostalgia. The original author is rarely on the site anymore, so it's unlikely to see edits to bring it up to current writing standards or tastes.</p>
<p>If you haven't done so, I recommend you read some more recent work, to see how articles may look different these days. Top Rated New Pages, accessible from the side bar menu, is a great place to start. Or, if you like the subjects of the SCPs, but not the article format, try reading some tales instead.</p>

